# Basic Auth Spring Boot Application

This is a simple Spring Boot application with basic authentication.

## Getting Started

### Prerequisites

- Java 11
- Maven

### Installation

1. Clone the repository:
    ```sh
    git clone https://github.com/Ishwarya-29/Springboot_product_Project.git
    ```
2. Navigate to the project directory:
    ```sh
    cd basicauth
    ```

### Configuration
In security config file mention the username and password , whatever you want to give and
here in this application auth is required for http://localhost:8080/student not for 
http://localhost:8080/student as we mentioned in security config file.